  <gltf_pbr name="Titanium__Anodized__GLTF_SHD_PBM" type="surfaceshader" uiname="Titanium (Anodized)" uifolder="Metal" doc="Titanium can be colorized by a process called anodization. It creates a layer of titanium dioxide by supplying different voltages which results in different thickness and color. Additional colors can be achieved by adding dyes.. Reference: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AntonPalmqvist/physically-based-api/main/images/renders/cycles/300/titanium-anodized.avif">
